# Book Metadata Project

Folders:
- input_pdfs/: put PDFs here
- extracted_text/: cached text JSONs
- ollama_outputs/: raw YAML from LLM
- obsidian_notes/: final .md notes
- audit_logs/: CSV / logs
- renamed_pdfs/: renamed PDFs after extraction

Step 1: create skeleton (this)
Step 2: text extraction (PyMuPDF / pdfminer) -> extracted_text/
Step 3: call Ollama -> save YAML in ollama_outputs/
Step 4: convert YAML -> obsidian_notes/ (frontmatter)
Step 5: rename PDFs into renamed_pdfs/

To list PDFs:
./runner.sh --list
